sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant Security as Account Security
  participant Intent as Link-intent API
  participant Provider
  participant Auth as Sign-in callback
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Person->>Security: Connect provider
  Security->>Intent: Request signed provider-bound intent
  Intent-->>Person: HttpOnly link-intent cookie
  Person->>Provider: Authenticate provider identity
  Provider-->>Auth: provider + subject
  Auth->>Auth: Validate current session and signed intent
  Auth->>DB: Confirm identity not owned elsewhere
  DB-->>Auth: Available or already owned by same User
  Auth->>DB: Link AuthProviderIdentity to User U123
  Auth-->>Security: Connected
